DESCRIPTION:« All Events\n 				\n				\n				\n				\n					\n	The Friday Social				\n				\n				\n				\n					\n		\n			August 7\n\n	\n\n	  @  \n\n\n6:00 PM\n\n		\n\n\n\n	\n	  -  \n\n8:00 PM\n\n\n\n	\n				\n				\n				\n				\n					\n	\n				\n				\n				\n				\n									The Friday Social is your new favorite way to kick off the weekend. Join us at Ruki’s Kitchen for an elevated happy hour celebrating bold Ethiopian cuisine\, global flavors\, and great company. In partnership with Stella Artois\, enjoy complimentary beer from the iconic Stella Artois Airstream\, exclusive swag\, live music from a DJ\, and an inviting atmosphere designed to help you unwind after the workweek. Whether you’re gathering with coworkers or meeting friends\, The Friday Social is the perfect place to experience international flavors\, connect with your community\, and start your weekend on a high note.   								\n				\n				\n				\n									\n					\n						\n									RSVP\n					\n					\n				\n								\n				\n				\n						\n					\n			\n						\n				\n					\n	\n\n	Categories:	\n		Atlanta	\n\n				\n				\n				\n				\n					\n	\n		\n\n	\n	Add to calendar	\n		\n	\n\n		\n			\n									\n	Google Calendar\n\n									\n	iCalendar\n\n									\n	Outlook 365\n\n									\n	Outlook Live\n\n							\n		\n\n		\n	\n\n				\n				\n					\n		\n				\n			\n						\n				\n					\n				\n				\n	\n			\n		Ruki’s Kitchen			\n	\n	\n	\n\n1161 Ridge Ave SW Suite 15\n	\n		\n		Atlanta\,\n\n\n	30315\n\n	United States\n\n\n\n\n	+ Google Map \n\n\n	\n					\n						\n	 \n\n\n	\n	 \n\n\n\n	\n\n		\n	\n				\n				\n					\n		\n					\n		\n				\n						\n					\n			\n						\n				\n					\n	\n		\n\n				Dining in the District	\n\n\n		\n	\n		BBQ & Brews
